# elect.sync as an instruction guard over a CTA of 128 threads: the
# elected lane of warp 0 stores 4 B, the elected lane of each of the 4
# warps 8 B, every other lane 2 B, and lane 0 stores 4 B only if it is
# its warp's elected lane, which is unspecified: the CTA stores 284 B
# plus a bound of 4, besides the 512 B its 128 threads load.
RUN: %ptxroof analyze %fixtures/micro/elect.ptx | FileCheck --check-prefix=ANN "%s"
ANN: {{^}}.visible .entry micro_elect( // block 128×1×1 | per CTA: global load 512 B, store <= 288 B; param load 2,048 B{{$}}
